=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  bruteforce firewall-review -----------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. firewall-offer's item 5, up to its$
# question: what the limit does, the rules as it leaves them,$
# the engine's plan, y/N.$
$
# Limit SSH ####################################################$
$
# Note$
# ufw refuses an address that opens 6 or more SSH connections in$
# 30 seconds, yours included.$
$
  Rules --------------------------------------------------------$
$
  [+] 22/tcp               Limit$
  [+] 22/tcp (v6)          Limit$
$
   -  Limit 22/tcp$
      ufw$
      -allow 22/tcp$
      +limit 22/tcp$
      $ ufw limit 22/tcp$
$
  Limit SSH? [y/N, 0 or q]:$
$
$

